WEBVTT

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:27.100
<b>The Fruit of Evolution 2:</b>

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:27.100
<b>Before I Knew It,
My Life Had It Made</b>

00:00:03.550 --> 00:00:04.430
Seiichi!

00:00:04.430 --> 00:00:06.680
<i>The Fruit of Evolution 2</i> is finally starting!

00:00:06.680 --> 00:00:07.810
It sure is, Saria.

00:00:07.810 --> 00:00:09.150
Wait, what is this setup?!

00:00:09.150 --> 00:00:10.650
What's evolved here, exactly?!

00:00:10.650 --> 00:00:12.120
Well, our feelings?

00:00:12.120 --> 00:00:13.420
It's not an issue of feelings!

00:00:13.420 --> 00:00:14.910
Then... motivation?

00:00:14.910 --> 00:00:16.180
Have that from the start!

00:00:16.180 --> 00:00:17.060
Well, then...

00:00:17.060 --> 00:00:18.480
The protagonist has changed?

00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:19.990
No, we're starring in this, too!

00:00:19.990 --> 00:00:22.970
Then look forward to seeing what 
actually evolved in the show!

00:00:22.970 --> 00:00:24.420
Now, <i>The Fruit of Evolution 2</i>...

00:00:24.420 --> 00:00:26.300
...begins at last!

00:01:09.770 --> 00:01:13.590
Is that all your strength 
amounts to, Seiichi-kun?

00:01:33.110 --> 00:01:34.650
You can still avoid my attacks?

00:01:47.140 --> 00:01:49.000
I've grown tired of this.

00:01:49.330 --> 00:01:51.040
We're done here.

00:01:52.740 --> 00:01:53.920
Bye-bye.

00:01:59.140 --> 00:02:03.830
Don't touch my Seiichi!

00:02:13.370 --> 00:02:15.110
Not bad.

00:02:34.100 --> 00:02:37.670
Seiichi!

00:02:41.700 --> 00:02:44.080
S-Saria...

00:02:44.080 --> 00:02:45.970
I'm coming for you!

00:02:51.940 --> 00:02:57.460
Saria truly is ugly as a gorilla.

00:03:01.780 --> 00:03:03.240
Bye-bye.

00:03:03.240 --> 00:03:04.040
Wait!

00:03:14.380 --> 00:03:20.220
S-Saria!

00:03:38.500 --> 00:03:40.490
S-Seiichi...

00:03:41.010 --> 00:03:42.890
When I'm a gorilla...

00:03:43.330 --> 00:03:43.910
Huh?

00:03:44.260 --> 00:03:45.480
Do you not like me?

00:03:59.530 --> 00:04:00.200
<i>H...</i>

00:04:01.250 --> 00:04:02.730
<i>How beautiful!</i>

00:04:02.730 --> 00:04:04.720
<i>Can I get my hopes up this time?!</i>

00:04:05.020 --> 00:04:07.890
Seiichi, what's wrong?

00:04:07.890 --> 00:04:10.260
Your face is all stiff.

00:04:10.260 --> 00:04:12.260
Onii-chan, are you okay?

00:04:12.260 --> 00:04:14.690
Did you have a bad dream?

00:04:15.450 --> 00:04:17.700
A dream, huh?

00:04:19.590 --> 00:04:21.390
I'm fine, Saria.

00:04:23.280 --> 00:04:25.860
<i>What was that dream about?</i>

00:04:26.610 --> 00:04:28.350
Everyone, behold!

00:04:34.840 --> 00:04:36.580
Thambuli!

00:04:36.580 --> 00:04:38.630
That's your new home!

00:04:39.230 --> 00:04:42.100
Barbador Magic Academy!

00:04:42.630 --> 00:04:44.440
Wow!

00:04:44.440 --> 00:04:46.440
Isn't this exciting, Seiichi?

00:04:46.440 --> 00:04:47.420
Yeah!

00:04:50.180 --> 00:04:53.880
<i>So this is where I'll 
start my new second life.</i>

00:04:58.860 --> 00:05:02.780
<b>The Fruit of Evolution 2:</b>

00:04:58.860 --> 00:05:02.780
<b>The Fruit of Evolution 2:</b>

00:04:59.940 --> 00:05:02.780
<b>Before I Knew It, My Life Had It Made</b>

00:04:59.940 --> 00:05:02.780
<b>Before I Knew It, My Life Had It Made</b>

00:04:59.940 --> 00:05:02.780
<b>Before I Knew It, My Life Had It Made</b>

00:06:26.000 --> 00:06:30.920
<b>Welcome to Barbador Magic Academy!</b>

00:06:48.730 --> 00:06:50.510
Come, come, I'll show you around.

00:06:50.890 --> 00:06:52.050
This way.

00:06:55.190 --> 00:06:57.370
I heard it creaking!

00:06:57.370 --> 00:06:58.700
Wow!

00:06:58.700 --> 00:07:01.140
What will they be feeding us here?

00:07:01.140 --> 00:07:02.970
We're not here to play around!

00:07:07.950 --> 00:07:10.550
As the name suggests, 
Barbador Magic Academy

00:07:10.550 --> 00:07:14.950
is where students seeking to 
master magic have gathered,

00:07:14.950 --> 00:07:18.290
creating the world's leading magic city.

00:07:18.620 --> 00:07:21.140
There are all kinds of shops here.

00:07:21.140 --> 00:07:23.120
So it's not just an academy, then.

00:07:23.120 --> 00:07:25.250
Master!

00:07:25.250 --> 00:07:29.660
Look! They're selling bakudan, too!

00:07:25.250 --> 00:07:30.090
