00:07:30.110 --> 00:07:32.450
<b>Delicious</b>

00:07:30.110 --> 00:07:32.450
<i>Delicious! Delicious!</i>

00:07:32.450 --> 00:07:35.130
You never change, Lulune.

00:07:35.130 --> 00:07:36.600
Hey!

00:07:36.860 --> 00:07:40.270
The entrance to the academy is over here!

00:07:40.270 --> 00:07:41.230
Let's go!

00:07:41.230 --> 00:07:44.050
Hey, doesn't Barnabus-san look too excited?

00:07:41.440 --> 00:07:44.050
Huh?! We're not eating?!

00:07:44.050 --> 00:07:46.690
If you keep being a glutton, 
you'll get left behind!

00:07:59.910 --> 00:08:02.830
We're complete outcasts now.

00:08:02.830 --> 00:08:03.780
Yeah.

00:08:03.780 --> 00:08:09.000
Everyone here views those of us who were
summoned from another world as enemies.

00:08:09.710 --> 00:08:13.610
Kannazuki-senpai, what are we supposed to do?

00:08:15.880 --> 00:08:17.040
It's coming!

00:08:17.360 --> 00:08:19.780
Huh? Wh-What's coming?

00:08:19.780 --> 00:08:20.830
I'm not sure,

00:08:20.830 --> 00:08:23.700
but I picked up a very nostalgic smell.

00:08:23.700 --> 00:08:25.350
Huh? You mean...

00:08:25.770 --> 00:08:27.420
It's Seiichi-kun!

00:08:27.420 --> 00:08:29.020
Huh? Seiichi?

00:08:30.060 --> 00:08:34.350
<i>Seiichi-kun, are you already close by?</i>

00:08:35.240 --> 00:08:37.990
Now, Seiichi-kun, let me tell you

00:08:37.990 --> 00:08:40.850
exactly what it is I'd like to ask of you.

00:08:41.220 --> 00:08:42.190
That's right.

00:08:42.190 --> 00:08:45.500
You only told me that you wanted 
me to be a teacher here.

00:08:45.940 --> 00:08:46.990
Yes.

00:08:46.990 --> 00:08:49.060
Children of royalty and nobility

00:08:49.060 --> 00:08:52.800
from many different nations 
come to this academy.

00:08:52.800 --> 00:08:57.180
Among them, we also have some 
who are from another world.

00:08:57.980 --> 00:08:58.970
<i>Does he mean...</i>

00:09:04.580 --> 00:09:09.130
They enrolled as hero candidates 
from the Kaiser Empire,

00:09:09.770 --> 00:09:12.400
but their latent abilities are so strong

00:09:13.110 --> 00:09:15.860
that they've been ostracized 
by our current students,

00:09:15.860 --> 00:09:18.190
and there's no end to their quarrels.

00:09:20.670 --> 00:09:23.070
<i>That's how they're being treated?</i>

00:09:24.180 --> 00:09:28.420
However, we don't know how the 
Kaiser Empire will respond

00:09:28.420 --> 00:09:31.920
if our academy punishes the hero candidates.

00:09:32.160 --> 00:09:33.800
So, Seiichi-kun...

00:09:33.800 --> 00:09:41.260
Bang! Your duty is to become the savior 
who maintains order at this academy!

00:09:41.260 --> 00:09:43.490
Savior?!

00:09:50.770 --> 00:09:51.950
<i>Water...</i>

00:09:52.980 --> 00:09:55.110
Seiichi, you're so cool!

00:09:55.110 --> 00:09:57.130
You are already d—

00:09:57.620 --> 00:09:59.970
Would younger kids even get that one?

00:09:59.970 --> 00:10:02.070
<i>Ask your mother or father.</i>

00:10:00.180 --> 00:10:02.070
