00:10:02.070 --> 00:10:06.350
So on that note, I'd like you to 
train up talented students,

00:10:06.350 --> 00:10:09.620
ones capable of matching 
the hero candidates!

00:10:09.840 --> 00:10:11.820
Good luck, Seiichi!

00:10:11.820 --> 00:10:14.920
I wonder if I'm capable of 
something so ambitious.

00:10:15.280 --> 00:10:19.300
So, what should we join this academy as?

00:10:19.300 --> 00:10:21.090
Don't worry.

00:10:21.090 --> 00:10:24.970
I've prepared the perfect posts 
for you all at the academy!

00:10:25.660 --> 00:10:28.820
First, Saria-kun and Lulune-kun,

00:10:29.510 --> 00:10:31.910
you'll be enrolling as students!

00:10:34.730 --> 00:10:36.130
What do you think, Seiichi?

00:10:36.130 --> 00:10:38.230
Do we look good, Master?

00:10:38.230 --> 00:10:40.650
S-So cute!

00:10:38.630 --> 00:10:40.650
So cute!

00:10:40.650 --> 00:10:43.570
Hearing Seiichi compliment me

00:10:43.940 --> 00:10:46.490
makes my... my...

00:10:46.490 --> 00:10:48.890
my heart feel like bursting!

00:10:48.890 --> 00:10:51.210
You're just bursting through your uniform!

00:10:51.520 --> 00:10:53.980
Next up, Artoria-kun...

00:10:55.520 --> 00:10:57.750
You'll be the Adventuring instructor

00:10:57.750 --> 00:11:00.190
who teaches students what every 
adventurer needs to know!

00:11:02.180 --> 00:11:05.270
Want to go adventuring with your teacher?

00:11:06.500 --> 00:11:09.680
Now, there's no resisting that!

00:11:10.390 --> 00:11:12.190
Don't make me say weird things!

00:11:12.790 --> 00:11:14.940
Next, Oliga-kun...

00:11:15.620 --> 00:11:17.660
will be Seiichi-kun's assistant!

00:11:17.660 --> 00:11:21.740
Professor, experiment with me!

00:11:21.740 --> 00:11:24.410
Moe!

00:11:22.300 --> 00:11:24.410
I will! I will!

00:11:24.710 --> 00:11:28.200
Don't make Oliga do weird things, either!

00:11:28.200 --> 00:11:31.380
Blasting off!

00:11:32.880 --> 00:11:34.730
Salute, Barna-san!

00:11:37.210 --> 00:11:40.830
So anyway, everyone, do your best!

00:11:40.830 --> 00:11:42.240
Yes, sir!

00:11:42.240 --> 00:11:43.340
Jeez.

00:11:43.340 --> 00:11:46.360
Now, let's head to the cafeteria first!

00:11:46.360 --> 00:11:48.420
You're eating again? You're such a glutton.

00:11:48.420 --> 00:11:51.280
Glutton? That sounds yummy!

00:11:50.390 --> 00:11:52.380
<i>I'll be a teacher, huh?</i>

00:11:51.280 --> 00:11:53.150
Would you two cut it out?!

00:11:53.150 --> 00:11:55.990
<i>You never know what will happen in life.</i>

00:11:57.290 --> 00:11:59.900
<i>I used to get bullied,</i>

00:12:00.730 --> 00:12:03.900
<i>but then I was suddenly 
transported to this world,</i>

00:12:04.700 --> 00:12:06.910
<i>where I had a gorilla 
challenge me to a fight,</i>

00:12:07.850 --> 00:12:09.630
<i>propose to me,</i>

00:12:10.610 --> 00:12:11.950
<i>and become my bride.</i>

00:12:12.700 --> 00:12:14.630
<i>Then I met lots of beautiful women,</i>

00:12:14.630 --> 00:12:17.640
<i>and before I knew it, I had it made.</i>

00:12:17.640 --> 00:12:20.050
<i>I fought a dark knight and a dragon.</i>

00:12:20.360 --> 00:12:22.940
<i>I got welcomed into an eccentric guild.</i>

00:12:22.940 --> 00:12:24.470
...muscle!

00:12:27.370 --> 00:12:28.600
<i>I fought...</i>

00:12:28.600 --> 00:12:29.890
Shall we do it?

00:12:29.890 --> 00:12:32.640
I'm good!

00:12:33.770 --> 00:12:34.890
<i>...and fought.</i>

00:12:42.830 --> 00:12:44.890
So much stuff happened.

00:12:45.310 --> 00:12:48.400
When I get back, I'm re-watching last season.

00:12:49.050 --> 00:12:52.380
But all of that started

00:12:52.380 --> 00:12:54.860
when I first ate the Fruit of Evolution.

00:12:59.920 --> 00:13:01.830
It tasted awful.

00:13:01.830 --> 00:13:03.630
Now then, Seiichi-kun...

00:13:03.630 --> 00:13:07.450
Let's start by heading to Class F, 
the class you'll be taking over.

00:13:07.810 --> 00:13:10.070
Class F?

00:13:10.070 --> 00:13:11.130
Yes.

00:13:11.130 --> 00:13:14.520
They're quite the collection 
of problem children.

00:13:14.520 --> 00:13:15.100
Huh?

00:13:15.790 --> 00:13:17.350
Problem children?

00:13:17.660 --> 00:13:20.100
Please, use your talents to—

00:13:20.520 --> 00:13:21.940
Huh?!

00:13:30.020 --> 00:13:32.400
You've finally returned, Principal?

00:13:32.400 --> 00:13:33.700
<i>Peel, peel...</i>

00:13:37.750 --> 00:13:38.410
<i>Huh?</i>

00:13:53.310 --> 00:13:54.720
Who are you?

00:13:55.110 --> 00:13:58.020
B-B-B-Beatrice-kun...

00:13:58.020 --> 00:13:59.330
Principal!

00:13:59.330 --> 00:14:01.190
Where have you been wandering

00:14:01.190 --> 00:14:04.730
all this time, without 
permission from us teachers?

00:14:04.730 --> 00:14:06.650
W-W-Well...

00:14:06.650 --> 00:14:10.910
There's a mountain of backed-up 
paperwork that needs your attention.

00:14:12.030 --> 00:14:14.410
I-It's not what you think...

00:14:14.410 --> 00:14:16.900
Do you have anything to say for yourself?

00:14:16.900 --> 00:14:19.260
I was working for the good of the academy...

00:14:19.260 --> 00:14:21.610
Ah, for the academy?

00:14:21.610 --> 00:14:23.290
Yes! Exactly!

00:14:23.290 --> 00:14:26.140
If you truly care about this academy,

00:14:26.140 --> 00:14:29.970
please start going through the mountain 
of backed-up paperwork before you.

00:14:29.970 --> 00:14:34.010
Be sure to go over every single 
page before you sign them.

00:14:34.700 --> 00:14:37.110
Can I bounce them?

00:14:39.560 --> 00:14:43.230
Guilty!

00:14:50.200 --> 00:14:52.650
Now, let's get going.

00:14:52.650 --> 00:14:54.350
Y-Yes, ma'am!

00:14:55.230 --> 00:15:00.290
Mountain...

00:15:05.060 --> 00:15:06.910
U-Um...

00:15:09.870 --> 00:15:12.240
I'm sorry about all that.

00:15:12.240 --> 00:15:14.930
I'm the teacher formerly 
in charge of Class F,

00:15:14.930 --> 00:15:17.510
Beatrice Rogner.

00:15:17.510 --> 00:15:19.600
Huh? Of Class F?

00:15:19.600 --> 00:15:20.450
Yes.

00:15:20.450 --> 00:15:27.190
The principal has instructed me to support 
you as the class's assistant teacher.

00:15:27.190 --> 00:15:29.280
I-I see.

00:15:33.300 --> 00:15:37.010
Now, our new Adventuring 
instructor, Artoria-sensei,

00:15:37.010 --> 00:15:40.200
and our new Class A student, 
Lulune-san, head this way.

00:15:40.200 --> 00:15:42.410
What?! I can't do that!

00:15:42.410 --> 00:15:44.260
I am Master's servant!

00:15:44.260 --> 00:15:47.640
I cannot be apart from my master!

00:15:47.640 --> 00:15:52.840
By the way, the cafeteria you 
sought is located next to Class A.

00:15:52.840 --> 00:15:55.940
The cafeteria!

00:15:56.330 --> 00:15:58.260
She's quick to change gears.

00:15:59.170 --> 00:16:00.870
Later, Seiichi.

00:16:00.870 --> 00:16:02.730
Let's both do our best.

00:16:02.730 --> 00:16:05.190
Yeah. Don't push yourself too hard, Ar.

00:16:05.190 --> 00:16:06.980
Later!

00:16:06.980 --> 00:16:09.610
Now, the rest of you, this way.

00:16:09.610 --> 00:16:10.510
Um...

00:16:11.270 --> 00:16:13.150
May I ask a question?

00:16:13.150 --> 00:16:14.360
What is it?

00:16:14.570 --> 00:16:18.610
You used to be in charge of Class F, right?

00:16:19.180 --> 00:16:21.910
A-Are you okay working with me?

00:16:23.830 --> 00:16:32.760
\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hPsst

00:16:24.110 --> 00:16:32.760
<i>Psst... Psst...</i>

00:16:24.670 --> 00:16:27.370
<i>Huh? Did I ask something I shouldn't have?</i>

00:16:27.780 --> 00:16:29.740
<i>Is she going to treat me like Barna-san?!</i>

00:16:29.740 --> 00:16:32.760
<i>Oh, jeez! I shouldn't have asked!</i>

00:16:33.250 --> 00:16:34.590
I...

00:16:37.870 --> 00:16:44.060
I wasn't able to help their talents bloom.

00:16:44.430 --> 00:16:45.060
Huh?

00:16:45.060 --> 00:16:47.800
It's wrong to call them problem children.

00:16:47.800 --> 00:16:50.560
They're all good children.

00:16:51.760 --> 00:16:55.070
No matter what anyone else says, 
I have faith in them.

00:16:55.810 --> 00:16:59.440
Faith that there's amazing talent 
lying within all of them.

00:17:01.250 --> 00:17:03.060
Beatrice-san...

00:17:03.060 --> 00:17:06.170
Also, if the principal has acknowledged you,

00:17:06.170 --> 00:17:10.050
I'm sure you can raise them 
into wonderful students.

00:17:16.420 --> 00:17:17.620
I understand.

00:17:17.620 --> 00:17:20.030
I don't know how well I'll 
meet your expectations,

00:17:20.030 --> 00:17:21.970
but I'll do my best.

00:17:21.970 --> 00:17:24.840
Don't worry, Beatrice-san!

00:17:24.840 --> 00:17:26.880
Seiichi is very kind!

00:17:26.880 --> 00:17:29.310
He'll definitely make a great teacher!

00:17:29.540 --> 00:17:32.410
Yeah. Onii-chan is kind.

00:17:33.860 --> 00:17:34.710
Right!

00:17:41.160 --> 00:17:43.190
<i>That being said...</i>

00:17:43.190 --> 00:17:46.080
<i>I don't know if I can teach.</i>

00:17:46.080 --> 00:17:47.230
Seiichi!

00:17:48.250 --> 00:17:49.430
Saria...

00:17:49.430 --> 00:17:50.810
Do your best!

00:17:55.770 --> 00:17:57.260
All right, here I go!

00:18:02.500 --> 00:18:04.270
<i>C'mon, that's too cliché!</i>

00:18:04.270 --> 00:18:06.800
<i>And it's a wash basin, 
not a blackboard eraser?!</i>

