00:18:06.040 --> 00:18:08.140
<i>Ask your grandmother 
and grandfather.</i>

00:18:10.340 --> 00:18:11.580
<i>It's all right!</i>

00:18:11.580 --> 00:18:15.380
<i>Even Beatrice-san said 
they're all good kids!</i>

00:18:37.120 --> 00:18:37.920
Huh?

00:18:54.240 --> 00:18:56.140
<i>A-Are they...</i>

00:18:56.860 --> 00:19:00.900
<i>Are they r-really good kids?!</i>

00:19:18.420 --> 00:19:23.760
All the students of Class F are super unique.

00:19:23.760 --> 00:19:27.570
What will happen to Seiichi in the end?

00:19:27.570 --> 00:19:29.060
What the hell?!

00:19:42.010 --> 00:19:45.690
<i>Our goal is the resurrection 
of the Great Devil.</i>

00:19:45.690 --> 00:19:46.650
<i>However,</i>

00:19:46.650 --> 00:19:51.910
<i>to achieve that, we need the negative 
emotions of mankind's despair.</i>

00:19:52.830 --> 00:19:54.530
<i>Well, Kreis?</i>

00:19:54.530 --> 00:19:56.080
<i>How is it going?</i>

00:19:58.720 --> 00:20:02.880
Our Great Devil Order has 
devised a secret plan.

00:20:02.880 --> 00:20:05.930
<i>Oh? And that is?</i>

00:20:05.930 --> 00:20:09.600
This time, we'll attack the 
Barbador Magic Academy.

00:20:09.600 --> 00:20:11.190
<i>I see.</i>

00:20:11.190 --> 00:20:15.730
<i>So you'll take the lives of 
VIPs from all over the world.</i>

00:20:15.730 --> 00:20:18.610
It's an effective tactic, right?

00:20:18.610 --> 00:20:21.570
And by contributing to the 
Great Devil's resurrection,

00:20:21.570 --> 00:20:24.650
I can prove my worth, as well.

00:20:31.010 --> 00:20:32.810
Wh-What is this?!

00:20:38.380 --> 00:20:39.910
Wh-Who are you?!

00:20:43.770 --> 00:20:46.290
You look like a roasted pig.

00:20:46.290 --> 00:20:49.010
What a pathetic little piglet.

00:20:49.550 --> 00:20:51.590
You're Demioros!

00:20:51.590 --> 00:20:53.180
And Angrea!

00:20:53.730 --> 00:20:56.230
What do you think you're doing here?!

00:20:56.230 --> 00:20:58.250
Nothing, really.

00:20:58.250 --> 00:21:02.150
We'll be the ones heading 
to Barbador Magic Academy.

00:21:02.150 --> 00:21:04.070
Wh-What?!

00:21:04.070 --> 00:21:08.250
We couldn't entrust it to some stupid pig.

00:21:08.250 --> 00:21:10.990
Th-The plan's still in the preparation stage!

00:21:11.210 --> 00:21:13.690
There's no preparation needed.

00:21:13.690 --> 00:21:15.910
Not if we go.

00:21:16.210 --> 00:21:20.590
Then you'll be finished.

00:21:22.500 --> 00:21:24.900
Well, there you have it.

00:21:24.900 --> 00:21:27.110
Farewell, piglet.

00:21:27.110 --> 00:21:28.580
W-Wait!

00:21:28.580 --> 00:21:30.510
Please wait!

00:21:30.510 --> 00:21:31.660
If you're going,

00:21:31.660 --> 00:21:34.350
undo this before you leave!

00:21:35.340 --> 00:21:37.300
Please!

00:21:39.700 --> 00:21:44.560
I can't wait to see how the 
students of that academy

00:21:44.560 --> 00:21:46.700
will scream for me.

00:21:48.940 --> 00:21:52.220
All for the Great Devil's resurrection.

00:23:35.680 --> 00:23:38.430
I finally start my job teaching classes!

00:23:38.430 --> 00:23:40.680
Or so I thought, but then the 
students start hazing me!

00:23:40.680 --> 00:23:43.640
But even those students 
harbor a serious problem!

00:23:43.640 --> 00:23:45.770
Next time: "Being a Teacher Is Tough!"

00:23:43.640 --> 00:23:45.770
<b>Next Time
Being a Teacher Is Tough!</b>

00:23:45.770 --> 00:23:48.020
Let's all just get along!
